   224	`FALLACY-v2 / flag-place-series`: the split order `delta`, the combined minor
   225	radius `delta*`, and the major radii are three different objects.  §2 gives:
   226	
   227	```text
   228	(A)  the principal packet splits below 7/2  ->  delta = 3, the face of §2.1,
   229	     the tree of §2.2, and delta* <= 3 < 7/2, so Prop. 6.3 is NOT licensed;
   230	(B)  it does not split below 7/2           ->  delta* >= 7/2 = v_s/u_s, which
   231	     is exactly Prop. 6.3's unproved premise, and Moh's descent runs, with
   232	     descended profile (g,f,T_2) = (24,16,14) and monomial Jacobian exponent
   233	     v_s - u_s - 1 = 4.
   234	```
   235	
   236	`(B)` is `DESCEND-WITH-MODIFIED-HYPOTHESIS`, not a proof of the premise;
   237	`OPEN[MINOR-RADIUS-108]` stands.  The lane's contribution is that `(A)` is now a
   238	*single, rigid* branch rather than an unclassified window.
   239	
   240	## 3. Joint-chart design for the surviving face
   241	
   242	`DERIVED`.  The chart is `g9966-global-design-sol56`'s two-point object,
   243	re-instantiated.  Approximate-root tower, Tschirnhausen-normalised (the
   244	`(k-1)`-th power dropped):
   245	
   246	```text
   247	h3 = P,                              y-degree d_3 = 9,   top form z^7 w^2
   248	h2 = P^4 + C2 P^2 + C3 P + C4,       y-degree d_2 = 36,  top form z^28 w^8
   249	F  = h2^3 + A2 h2 + A3,              y-degree n = 108
   250	G  = h2^2 + B1 h2 + B2,              y-degree m = 72
   251	```
   252	
   253	(`F` is the degree-`n` object, `G` the degree-`m` one — the charged design
   254	report's naming, opposite to the campaign's `f = m`, `g = n`.)  `w = z+1`;
   255	`P`'s leading form is `y^{u_s}(y-x)^{v_s} = y^2(y-x)^7`.
   256	
