   266	and `72`, so the tower is a coordinate chart, not a heuristic; the `(99,66)` row
   267	reproduces the charged design report's counts exactly.  Fixing the two top forms
   268	removes `180`, leaving **`8514`** named coordinates (`7161` at `(99,66)`).
