     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Outer Theorem-1.2 D2/D1 order bands on the (99,66) A,B blocks.
     3	
     4	Add-on: does not modify box/g9966-20260903/.  The (r,q) coordinates are those
     5	of K_Q = t^D Q(t^{-1}, w/t) in the invertible basis t^r (w-1)^q.
     6	
     7	SOURCE: Moh 1983 Theorem 1.2 (printed p.149): if
     8	  Q = h^d + sum_j Q_j h^{d-j}  with deg_y Q_j < deg_y h,
     9	then ord Q_j(sigma) >= j * (lambda/d) = j * ord h(sigma).
    10	
    11	Chart (2.1), first (major) point, D2 then D1:
    12	  ord h2(D2)=-1,  ord h2(D1)=-1/9.
    13	  F = h2^3 + A2 h2 + A3  =>  ord A2 >= 2 ord h2,  ord A3 >= 3 ord h2
    14	  G = h2^2 + B1 h2 + B2  =>  ord B1 >= 1 ord h2,  ord B2 >= 2 ord h2
    15	
    16	D2 substitution: t=s^3, w=1+pi s^4, weight 3r+4q.
    17	D1 substitution: t=e^9, w=1+e^{12}+Pi e^{13}.
    18	Theorem 1.2 is >= : the equality face is allowed, not a row.
