codex
A key structural check has surfaced: under the charged design’s new weight \(4r+6q\), the expected \(h_2\) equality face may demand a normalized coefficient outside the degree-36 support. I’m checking this at the projected \(h_2\) level before building later bands, because a genuine constant obstruction there would terminate the split branch earlier than any pole/Jacobian stage.
