   261	## 3. Task (2) — `OPEN[DESCENT-POLYGON]`
   262	
   263	### 3.1 The descent, as printed (SOURCE-READ, pp.196–198)
   264	
   265	Prop 6.3 (p.197). Hypotheses: `g` monic in `y`, `deg g = deg_y g = n > 1`, `δ_s = −1`,
   266	and the logarithmic radius of the minor disc satisfies `δ*_{s−1} ≥ v_s/u_s`. With
   267	`z` defined by equation (10), `y^{-1} = θ`, and `g, T_1^ψ,…,T_{s−1}^ψ` regarded as
