   269	`σ = Σ a_j θ^j + π θ^{v_s/u_s}` such that with `γ = θ^{1/u_s}`:
   270	
   271	1. `ḡ(σ), T̄_1^ψ(σ),…,T̄_{s−1}^ψ(σ) ∈ k[γ,π]`;
   272	2. they are monic in `π` of π-degrees `u_s n/d_s, u_s(−μ_1)/d_s, …, u_s(−μ_{s−1})/d_s`;
   273	3. `J_{γ,π}(ḡ(σ), T_1^{−ψ}(σ)) = −(u_s/b) γ^{v_s−u_s−1}`.
