   278	`ḡ(σ) = ḡ_σ(π) + (terms of higher degree in θ and lower degree in π)`,
   279	`deg ḡ_σ(π) = u_s n/d_s`. Prop 6.4 (p.198): if in addition `u_s = 1` then
