     2	"""Calibration controls for the outer-band / T2-T3 add-on.
     3	
     4	(16,12): Moh Appendix II, printed p.208.  u_s=1 on the (64,48) parent, so the
     5	effective-root bridge is trivial (single Puiseux branch; T_i(sigma) are powers
     6	of a linear polynomial).  The printed 17-coefficient chart *is* the
     7	order-band truncation of the approximate-root tower.  Both c5 readings, with
     8	Rabinowitsch wrapper T*kappa-1, Groebner over GF(32003) grevlex, are [1].
     9	Ring, wrapper, and both controls declared.
    10	
    11	Automorphism: F=a x+y, G=(a-1)x+y, J=1.  Degrees (1,1): the s=3 D1/D2 bands
    12	and T2,T3 of degree 55,145 are NOT-APPLICABLE.  The plumbing must not kill it.
    13	
    14	Order-spine unit identity (charged design §4.1) is rechecked over Q.
