+# D = 108 joint-chart band engine (packet Q3)
+
+Status: **SKELETON — UNSEALED**
+
+## 0. Scope, frozen inputs, and execution controls
+
+_To record receipt-derived SHA-256 verification, bounded-write policy, core cap, foreground timeouts, software versions, and reproducibility commands._
+
+## 1. Mathematical datum and branch ledger
+
+_To state the `(108,72)` datum, the unique admissible `delta = 3` principal-minor split, the no-split alternative, and all conventions without conflating flags, places, or cover series._
+
+## 2. Adaptation map from the charged `(99,66)` engine
+
+_To enumerate every retained convention and every replaced constant: degrees, tower, top two-line form, order range, outer bands, incidence packets, pole exponents, and Jacobian range._
+
+## 3. Compiled D = 108 skeleton and exact row counts
+
+### 3.1 Variables, coefficient field, gauge, and ring maps
+
+_Pending._
+
+### 3.2 Theorem-1.2 order rows
+
+_Pending._
+
+### 3.3 Outer `D2` support preblock and `D1` rows
+
+_Pending._
+
+### 3.4 Minor-incidence rows for `delta = 3`
+
+_Pending._
+
+### 3.5 Pole rows
+
+_Pending._
+
+### 3.6 Jacobian rows
+
+_Pending._
+
+## 4. Band engine and stage protocol
+
+_To document exact `Q*` pivot reduction, residue tests, rank/dimension definitions, stop rules, logs, and replay controls._
+
+## 5. D = 108 run
