+- **Localization:** the ideal component is displayed in
+  `Q[jet1,jet2,c,Zc]`, `c` is excluded from rational pivots, `Zc*c-1` is
+  explicit, and raw/empty/point controls plus a unit lift are run.
+- **Remainders and maps:** zero rows are counted; the correct scalar sign is
+  checked; the five nonzero normal forms are displayed. `e0` is not mapped by
+  name to an `F,G` coordinate. Prime marks in descended data are labels;
+  `dU/dpi` is written explicitly when differentiation is meant.
+- **Descent:** Proposition 6.3 is used only on the stated no-split premise.
+  Proposition 6.4 is not substituted. The missing ordinary-support map is
+  typed `OPEN`, rather than filled by a cap or analogy.
+- **Merge/arrival:** no merge-free or arrival-index claim is made in this lane.
