+| `c, Zc*c-1` | -1 | 0 | expected empty localization |
+| `c-1, Zc*c-1` | 2 (`jet1,jet2` free) | 1 | expected nonempty point control |
+
+Thus the wrapper, coefficient field, generator order, and both positive and
