+Stage `s` would add power `4+s`, displayed cleared exponents
+`F:-92+s`, `G:-60+s`. At powers 96 and 64 the engine must subtract `p^12`
+and `p^8`; merely inserting total coefficients would be wrong. These rows are
+compiled metadata only, because §5.1 is already terminal.
