+```text
+prior:       degree 177, w powers 15..24 (10 rows)
+stage 0:     degree 177, w power 25
+stage 1:     degree 177, w powers 26..177
+stage n>=2:  degree 178-n, all w powers 0..178-n.
+```
+
+At degree zero the target is `1`; positive-degree targets are zero. No row in
+this schedule was imposed after the incidence unit was found.
